# Copy to app/.env (git-ignored). Restart Expo after changing it.
# The support-circle server on your laptop. Phones use the laptop's Wi-Fi address
# (e.g. http://192.168.1.20:8000); the web demo can use http://localhost:8000.
# Leave empty to show the circle as "not set up on this version".
EXPO_PUBLIC_CIRCLE_API_URL=
# The AI coach service (milestone 9), port 8001. Use http://localhost:8001: for the web
# demo directly, for a phone after `adb reverse tcp:8001 tcp:8001` (USB). A Wi-Fi address
# (http://192.168.x.x:8001) is unencrypted; the coach screen then shows a warning.
# Leave empty to show the coach as "not set up on this version".
EXPO_PUBLIC_COACH_API_URL=
